EXTRA QUESTIONS
Q: What is TF-IDF? A: Term Frequency-Inverse Document Frequency. TF = how often a word appears in a doc. IDF = log(total docs / docs containing the word). Words common in all docs get low weight.
Q: What libraries are used for text processing in Python? A: nltk (NLP), re (regex), scikit-learn (vectorizers), pandas (data handling).
